POST https://api.push.apple.com/3/device/<device_token>
Ylätunnisteet: apns-topic: <bundle_id>, apns-push-type: alert, apns-collapse-id: room:42
Teksti: {aps: {alert: {title, body}}, tiedot: <sinetöity>}

